  - name: "Special Magic Power 2: Sense Location of a Particular Plant, Tree or Herb"
    description: "After taking a hallucinogen or an herb of divination, sees the location of one type of plant in his mind and can follow the mental picture of the path to it. Range: five miles (8 km) per level of experience. P.P.E. Cost: 5; underground water can be located the same way for 20 P.P.E."
  - name: "Special Magic Power 3: Heal Plant Life"
    description: "Links with a tree or plant, diagnoses the exact cause of its sickness (frostbite, drought, damage, disease, insects) and channels P.P.E. into it to cure and strengthen it. P.P.E. Cost: 2 for a small plant or flower, 5 for shrubs and bushes, 10 for a sapling, 20 for a young adult tree, 40 for an old tree (100+ years), 70 for an ancient tree (500+ years) or an alien plant."
  - name: "Special Magic Power 4: Accelerate the Growth of Common Trees & Plants"
    description: "A single common (not exotic, alien or legendary) tree or plant already growing reaches full maturity within 1D6 minutes, its general shape and size molded by the herbalist; a tree may be kept to a fraction of its height like a bonsai. Cannot grow a plant from seed. P.P.E. Cost: 30."
  - name: "Special Magic Power 5: Temporarily Shrink Plants"
    description: "Full grown plants fold up and seem to shrink to half their size, in a 50 foot (15.2 m) radius per level of experience. P.P.E. Cost: 30; lasts up to 10 minutes per level of experience."
  - name: "Special Magic Power 6: Shape/Sculpt Trees and Plants"
    description: "Alters branches, leaves and burls or twists the trunk of a living tree or plant into artistic, human, animal or monstrous shapes. Permanent unless changed again by its sculptor or another herbalist. P.P.E. Cost: 35 per tree."
  - name: "Special Magic Power 7: Shape Wood"
    description: "Dead or processed wood becomes like modeling clay in his hands: a spear, bow, canoe or statue can be worked by hand, and arrows, spears, handles and the like bent or twisted. Cannot punch holes in doors, floors, boards or boats. P.P.E. Cost: 40; lasts 20 minutes per level of experience."
  - name: "Special Magic Power 8: Animate Plants and Trees"
    description: "Branches and vines of one tree or plant at a time flail, hit, grab and entangle like arms, and may hold weapons (-1 to strike with swords and the like, -4 with energy and modern weapons). Attacks per melee equal the herbalist''s level. Adult tree: 3D4x100 S.D.C., large branch 3D6x10, smaller branch 1D6x10; P.S. 40 and 4D6 S.D.C. damage. Sapling P.S. 25, 2D6; shrub P.S. 10, 1D6; vine P.S. 7, 1D4. P.P.E. Cost: 40; lasts two minutes per level of experience."
  - name: "Special Magic Power 9: One with the Forest"
    description: "Disappears completely among sufficient foliage, like the chameleon spells; cannot move, attack or use magic or psionics while hidden, and sensors and thermo-imagers read only the cool radiation of the plants around him. P.P.E. Cost: 10; lasts up to five minutes per level of experience."
  - name: "Special Magic Power 10: Metamorphosis into a Tree"
    description: "Becomes a tree indistinguishable from others; cannot move, attack or use magic but keeps all senses and can whisper. Vulnerable to anything that hurts a tree, with an additional 200 S.D.C. Can be cancelled at any time or lasts 10 minutes per level of experience. P.P.E. Cost: 150."
